data: {"id":"chatcmpl-9266621b-dc09-4c68-9279-24caef745171","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1790745031,"model":"capitoline-judge-sol6","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"```python\nr'(?:0|[1-9][0-9]?|1[0-9]{2}|2[0-4][0-9]|25[0-5])(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]?|1[0-9]{2}|2[0-4][0-9]|25[0-5])){3}'\n```\n\nUse it with `re.fullmatch(pattern, text)`. Each octet is 0–255 without leading zeros, and `fullmatch` rejects anything outside the four octets."},"finish_reason":null}]}

